# Used by beanguard-server/Dockerfile, which builds from the repo root
# (it needs the whole Maven reactor: root pom + beanguard-api +
# beanguard-client + beanguard-server). Everything below is irrelevant to
# that build and would otherwise bloat the Docker build context.
#
# beanguard-demo/Dockerfile is unaffected - it's a standalone Maven project
# and builds with beanguard-demo/ itself as the context, not the repo root.

.git
.github
.idea
.claude
.superpowers

# Build output / dependency caches (rebuilt fresh inside the image anyway)
**/target
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/build
**/out

# Docs, not needed to compile/package the server
docs
licenses
*.md
